      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The pilot data demonstrates robust potential for our target therapeutic, with a statistically non-trivial trend strongly supporting the initial biological hypothesis. While further validation through a larger cohort is required for definitive regulatory approval, the directionality and effect magnitude provide compelling evidence of mechanism-of-action that de-risks the development pipeline. We are now well-positioned to advance to a definitive trial, and the requested funding will directly enable the scale-up necessary to transition this promising signal into a clinically approved treatment.",
      "source": "target",
